                                        Deborah Crawford is the President of gettechnical inc. She specializes in compliance and regula<img align="right" alt="Deborah Crawford" border="0" height="152" hspace="7" src="http://cuwebinars.com/content/images/presenters/Crawford.jpg" style="width: 114px; height: 152px;" title="Deborah Crawford" vspace="5" width="114" />tions for the deposit side of financial institutions. Her 20+ year career in banking and training began at Hibernia National Bank. She has been a seminar leader for many state associations and credit union groups across the nation. She has Bachelors and Masters degrees from Louisiana State University.<br />
